0,Austronesian languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Austronesian_languages,"Major Austronesian languages include Malay (one variant standardized as Indonesian [4][5]), Javanese, Sundanese, Tagalog (standardized as Filipino), [6] Malagasy and Cebuano. According to some estimates, the family contains 1,257 languages, which is the second most of any language family. [7]",Inonhan,Austronesian
